        "evidence_excerpt": "Note that Islam is called “Mohammadanism”. Note that \nthese piratical “Mohammadans” refused “in many cases” to \npermit conversion; the logical conclusion is that in vome cases \nthey did permit it—but the author prefers to avoid this con- \nclusion, and to speak only in negative terms about mere \n“Mohammadans” and pirates.",
