        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "We must skip over the fascinating unfolding of political \nstructures in the subsequent history of Algiers, simply \nbecause it cannot offer us much help in understanding our \nchief interest, Salé. As for what we might call the specific \nethnography or socio-history of Algerian piracy, we will cer- \ntainly return to it for comparative material when discussing, \nsay, the erotic mores or economic arrangements of the \nCorsairs of Bou Regreg in Morocco. But one more Algerian \ntheme must detain us before we depart for the Far West — \nthe Renegadoes.",
