        "evidence_excerpt": "Ali Bignin (a corruption of his name, Picenino) flour- \nished in Algiers during the same period (1630's—60's) which \nalso saw the establishment of the Bou Regreg Republic in \nMorocco, and which seems to have been the real golden age \nof the Barbary corsairs.",
