        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Danser also led the Algerians farther \nafield than they had ever navigated before. \nThey passed through the Strait of Gibraltar, \npenetrated the Atlantic, and ranged as far \nnorth as Iceland, where a corsair squadron \nswept the coast in 1616....",
