        "evidence_excerpt": "Four years later (1615) he died in the Hospital of St. \nMary of Pity at Messina [Senior, 1976: 98]. Truly he “came \nto a bad end”, as the old-time chroniclers always said of the \npirates—whether it was true or not.",
        "years_in_scope": [
