        "evidence_excerpt": "inside the walls. The autocrats of the old city were his most \nenthusiastic supporters, and Salé now also declared itself \nindependent under his spiritual/political authority. There \nwere now three republics on the Bou Regreg —all engaged in \nHoly War—and piracy—and rebellion against the \nSaadians —and incessant quarrels with each other.",
