        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "This is a confusing situation, and the sources are also \nconfused, but as far as I understand it, the situation was this: \nthe Hornacheros financed piracy and built the fleet, and \ntended both to resent the old autocrats of Salé and to bully \nthe lower-class Moriscos or Andalusians of Rabat. The",
        "years_in_scope": [],
