        "evidence_excerpt": "Thus Berehaven and Baltimore were not \npirate lairs in the sense that they were owned \nby self-confessed sea-robbers who used them \nas an essential base for their operations. They \nwere useful stations into which any pirate \ncould sail to secure a long price for his cargoes",
        "years_in_scope": [],
