        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "So it seems only the Celts were set free! Irish and \nCornish “prisoners” released, and English captives taken back \nto Algiers! And above all, the ubiquitous Hackett, so infor- \nmative, so...enthustastic about this chance to cooperate with \nMoorish corsairs! He would have done better to stick with \nMurad and flee to Algiers. But presumably he had reasons to \nremain in Ireland—perhaps to report to Sir Walter? To be \npaid off?",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
