        "evidence_excerpt": "ty was reported. “One day I saw in the street more than 100 \nwomen rushing pell-mell to console the wife of that renegade \nand corsair” [Murad Reis]; “this they accomplished, vying \nwith one another in great demonstrations of dole and woe, \nnot without shedding of tears, whether real or feigned, as is \ntheir custom upon such untoward and fatal occasions.”",
