      {
        "finding_id": "section-c53190a05efee0a917a0",
        "file": "pirate-utopias-hakim-bey_Pirate_Utopias_Bey_0_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Pirate Utopias: Moorish Corsairs & European Renegadoes",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/pirate-utopias-hakim-bey",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": [
            "Hakim Bey"
          ],
          "date": [
            "1995-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": "OCR_CONTEXT",
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "As for the corsairs’ notorious bad behaviour —drunkery, \nwhoring, carousing, and rioting—obviously not even the \nrowdiest rogue could keep it up full-time from autumn till \nspring. Little by little the Europeans and especially the \nRenegadoes would fall into Moorish rhythms of life—a daily \nroutine, whether work or socializing in cafés, punctuated by \nweddings, funerals, circumcisions, festivals, public perfor- \nmances by dervish orders, and of course the occasional out- \nbreak of feuding between Salé and Rabat. A Renegado might \nbegin to take an interest in religion out of ennui if nothing \nelse —after all, the local culture was thoroughly commingled \nwith and permeated by spirituality, and it must have been \nhard to avoid. If our Renegado had learned some Arabic, or \nmarried into a Spanish-speaking Morisco family, he might \nlearn quite a lot simply by watching and listening. Some, per- \nhaps, might go so far as to get involved on some level.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/pirate-utopias-hakim-bey",
          "source_file": "pirate-utopias-hakim-bey_Pirate_Utopias_Bey_0_djvu.txt",
          "start_char": 269418,
          "end_char": 270375,
          "start_line": 6873,
          "end_line": 6888,
          "printed_page": null,
          "scan_indexes_0_based": [],
          "pdf_file": null,
          "pdf_reference_base": "LANE_ROOT",
