        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "As a preliminary move in this analysis, it might prove \ninteresting to compare the political structure of the Triple \nRepublic with other political structures. Two obvious com- \nparisons spring to mind—first, the other Barbary states, \nespecially Algiers; and second, other “pirate utopias” else- \nwhere in the world.",
