        "evidence_excerpt": "Hispaniola, where the Buccaneers created their own short- \nlived highly anarchic society; Libertatia, in Madagascar; \nRanter’s Bay, also in Madagascar; and Nassau, in the \nBahamas, which was the last classical pirate utopia.",
