        "source_text_sha256": "ebef0a63c86f8eca812a0716c8fde4bac770ce246530d69bc074d6640e161000",
        "evidence_excerpt": "“When the Renegadoes disappeared, they left behind \nthem no “issue” —no obvious permanent trace of their exis- \ntence. In Madagascar the pirates’ “half-breed” children creat- \ned a new culture, but in North Africa the converts and their \ndescendants were simply absorbed into the general popula- \ntion. Their influence on European civilization seems to be nil,",
