        "evidence_excerpt": "rom \nthe \n16th to \nthe 19th \ncentury, \nMoslem \ncorsairs \n‘ 2 vin the \nBarbary Coast ravaged European shipping \nand enslaved many thousands of mets \ncoptives. During this period, however, thou- \nsonds of Europeans also converted to Islam \nand joined the pirate “holy war”. Were \nthese men (and women) the scum of the \nseas, apostates, traitors — “Renegadoes”? \nOr did they abandon and betray Christ- \nendom as 0 praxis of social resistance?",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "UNRESOLVED",
        "date_evidence": null,
