        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "to  watch  is  the  absolute  domination  obtained  by \nthe  leaders  over  their  followers.  There  is  no  other \nrecord  of  pirates  who  commanded  on  so  large  a \nscale  ;  there  is  none  which  shows  men  such  as  these \nbargaining  on  equal  terms  with  the  great  ones  of \nthe  earth.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
