        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "ticlers.  There  is  for  this  a  reason  apart  from  the \nrecord  of  robbery  and  murder,  which  is  the  com- \nmonplace of  piratical  deeds  :  it  resides  in  the  peren- \nnial interest  which  men  take  in  individual  achieve- \nment, in  the  spectacle  of  absolute  and  complete \ndomination  by  one  man  over  the  lives  and  the  for- \ntunes of  others.  This  intense  form  of  individualism \nis  nowhere  so  well  exhibited  as  in  the  story  of  pirat-",
