        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "cipline,  were  summed  up  in  one  trite  formula ; \nbut  though  we,  at  this  distance  of  time,  may  hold \nit  somewhat  in  derision,  it  was  a  vital  force  in  the \ndays  of  Soliman  the  Magnificent ;  and  there  was \nan  added  zest  to  robbery  and  murder  in  the  fact \nthat  the  pirates,  as  good  Mohammedans,  were \nobeying  the  behests  of  the  Prophet  every  time \nthat  they  cut  a  Christian  throat,  plundered  a \nChristian  argosy,  or  carried  off  shrieking  women \ninto  a  captivity  far  worse  than  death.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
