        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Although  the  \"  renegado  \"  was  very  much  in \nevidence  in  the  vessels  of  the  Moslem  corsairs, \nstill  of  course  the  bulk  of  the  righting  men,  by \nwhich  the  galleys  were  manned,  were  Moham- \nmedans, the  descendants  of  the  warriors  who  had \nswept  through  Northern  Africa  like  a  living  flame \nin  the  early  days  of  the  Mohammedan  conquest.",
