        "evidence_excerpt": "We  have  said  that  the  real  interest  in  the  lives \nof  the  corsairs  arose  from  the  fact  that  it  was  per- \nsonal ascendancy,  and  that  alone,  which  counted \nin  the  piratical  hierarchy.  Against  Kheyr-ed-Din",
