        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Uruj  was  informed  of  all  that  was  going  on  through \nhis  own  spies,  and,  although  he  kept  his  finger  on \nthe  pulse  of  the  conspiracy,  he  acted  as  though",
