        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "As  soon  as  the  anchors  were  down  a  party  of  two \nthousand  picked  men  were  landed  and  marched \nsilently  and  with  all  expedition  to  the  castle  of  Fundi. \nThe  escape  of  the  Duchess  was  really  providential. \nShe  had  already  gone  to  bed,  and  the  fierce  marau- \nders were  actually  within  the  grounds  of  the  castle \nbefore  her  distracted  people  became  aware  of  their \npresence.  But  fortunately  some  among  them  kept \ntheir  heads,  and  it  also  so  happened  that  her  bed- \nchamber was  the  opposite  side  of  the  castle  to  that \nby  which  the  pirates  approached.  A  horse  was",
