        "evidence_excerpt": "Dire  was  the  vengeance  taken  by  the  corsairs. \nThey  sacked  Fundi  and  burned  the  town  ;  they \nkilled  every  man  on  whom  they  could  lay  their \nhands,  and  carried  off  the  women  and  girls  to  the \nfleet.",
