        "evidence_excerpt": "Torch-bearers  among  the  pirates  leaped  into  houses \nand  set  them  ablaze,  the  flames  volleyed  and  crackled, \nthe  dense  smoke  rolled  upwards  to  the  stainless \nsky,  the  night  was  a  hell  of  blood  and  fire.",
