        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "but  he  was  hotly  pursued  by  the  corsairs,  who  fol- \nlowed him  up  to  Al-Burdon,  where  his  summer \npalace  was  situated.  Hamid,  finding  that  his \npeople  were  everywhere  in  revolt,  fled  to  the  Go- \nletta,  carrying  with  him  a  quantity  of  money, \njewels,  and  portable  valuables,  and  placed  himself \nunder  the  protection  of  the  Spanish  garrison — not, \nhowever,  without  the  loss  of  the  major  portion  of \nhis  baggage,  plundered  from  him  by  certain  Moors \nin  the  course  of  his  flight.",
