        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "of  June  in  the  following  year  to  enable  him  to  leave \nTunis  in  the  hands  of  one  Rabadan,  a  Sardinian \nrenegado,  and  to  start  himself  for  Constantinople. \nHis  reason  for  doing  this  was  the  old  one  of  at- \ntempting to  consolidate  his  power  in  Northern \nAfrica  by  appealing  to  the  Sultan  for  help.  As \nlong  as  the  Goletta  remained  in  the  hands  of  the \nSpaniards  no  corsair  could  feel  himself  secure  in \neither  Tunis  or  Algiers.  The  object  of  All  was  to \nbeg  from  the  Grand  Turk  men  and  ships  to  assist \nhim  to  chase  the  Spaniards  out  of  Africa.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
